          <button id="tt-filter-2" onclick="filterTechTree('2')" class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold bg-[#121620] hover:bg-white/[0.04] text-[#94a3b8] hover:text-[#f1f5f9] border border-white/[0.08] cursor-pointer">Tier 2 (Bens Básicos)</button>
