          <button onclick="switchEncyclopediaTab('products')" id="wiki-tab-products" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold transition bg-[#c9a86a]/15 text-[#c9a86a] border border-[#c9a86a]/40 shadow-sm">📦 Produtos</button>
